# Auto-push to GitHub

This project tracks https://github.com/sjiyoungan/Mybudget.git.

After finishing a requested change:

1. Commit the relevant files if the user asked to save, ship, or push the work, or if they asked to automatically push updates.
2. Push to `origin` on the current branch (`git push -u origin HEAD` when the upstream is missing).
3. Do not force-push unless the user explicitly asks.

Never commit `.env` files, credentials, or secrets.
